tSize":7},{"text":"Health care institutions, government payers, and","rect":[131.331,341.0012,274.11699999999996,348.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"vendors should support the use of telemedicine/","rect":[131.3308,332.0012,274.69780000000003,339.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"telestroke resources and systems to ensure","rect":[131.3308,322.9992,260.57179999999994,329.9992],"fontSize":7},{"text":"adequate 24-hour/day and 7-day/week coverage","rect":[131.3308,313.99719999999996,275.8451,320.99719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"and care of patients with AIS in various settings.","rect":[131.3308,304.99519999999995,274.26239999999996,311.99519999999995],"fontSize":7},{"text":"2b","rect":[62.968800000000016,269.24619999999993,71.27780000000001,276.24619999999993],"fontSize":7},{"text":"B-NR","rect":[93.22980000000001,269.24619999999993,111.0168,276.24619999999993],"fontSize":7},{"text":"7.","rect":[123.75,291.7512,128.594,298.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"For patients with AIS presenting to hospitals","rect":[130.841,291.7512,270.40000000000043,298.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"with telestroke capability, use of telestroke","rect":[130.8409,282.7512,263.9739000000005,289.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"may be reasonable for triage of patients who","rect":[130.8409,273.7492,270.3649000000005,280.7492],"fontSize":7},{"text":"may be eligible for appropriate interfacil","rect":[130.8409,264.74719999999996,254.9719000000005,271.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"-","rect":[255.1469000000003,264.74719999999996,257.1909000000003,271.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"ity transfer for emergency EVT versus local","rect":[130.8409,255.74519999999998,264.65290000000044,262.74519999999995],"fontSize":7},{"text":"care.","rect":[130.8409,246.74319999999997,146.12890000000004,253.74319999999997],"fontSize":7},{"text":"12,14,15,22,24–27","rect":[146.3037,249.72438,182.522575,253.80537999999999],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"Synopsis","rect":[49.5,214.96620000000001,89.9,224.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Telestroke technology has been instrumental in bridg","rect":[49.5,202.96620000000001,279.95000000000005,212.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96,202.96620000000001,283.5,212.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ing gaps in access for patients in remote locations or","rect":[49.5,190.96620000000001,283.5200000000001,200.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"who would not have otherwise had access to stroke-","rect":[49.5,178.96620000000001,283.48000000000013,188.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"related expertise. Telestroke has applications across the","rect":[49.5,166.96620000000001,283.50000000000006,176.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"continuum of care. In the prehospital setting, the use of","rect":[49.5,154.96620000000001,283.5250000000002,164.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"telemedicine in the ambulance may be advantageous to","rect":[49.5,142.96620000000001,283.5200000000001,152.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"identify candidates for reperfusion interventions and, in","rect":[49.5,130.96620000000001,283.4800000000002,140.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"turn, guide transport destination decisions and facilitate","rect":[49.5,118.9662,283.51000000000005,128.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"preparations at the receiving hospital.","rect":[49.5,106.9662,214.15000000000003,116.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1–4","rect":[214.1515,111.2136,224.34817,117.0436],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"In the acute","rect":[229.40800000000002,106.9662,283.498,116.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ED setting, teleradiology and telestroke are valuable","rect":[49.49800000000002,94.9662,283.49800000000016,104.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"for enabling timely reviews of brain imaging, facilitat","rect":[49.49800000000002,82.9662,279.9480000000001,92.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.95799999999997,82.9662,283.498,92.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ing thrombolytic decision-making, and optimizing timeli","rect":[49.49799999999999,70.9662,279.95900000000006,80.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.959,70.9662,283.499,80.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ness of thrombolytic delivery.","rect":[49.49799999999999,58.9662,171.91199999999998,68.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"5,7,8","rect":[171.9137,63.2136,182.85078000000001,69.0436],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Recent nonrandomized","rect":[186.4956,58.9662,283.5006,68.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"studies have also demonstrated the benefit of telestroke","rect":[301.50059999999996,713.3561999999998,535.5205999999998,723.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"for","rect":[301.50059999999996,701.3561999999998,312.9706,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"improving","rect":[319.0505999999999,701.3561999999998,359.27059999999994,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"patient","rect":[365.3505999999998,701.3561999999998,393.9005999999998,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"outcomes,","rect":[399.98059999999975,701.3561999999998,442.49059999999974,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"including","rect":[448.5705999999997,701.3561999999998,485.8605999999997,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"short-term","rect":[491.94059999999956,701.3561999999998,535.5005999999996,711.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"mortality.","rect":[301.50059999999996,689.3561999999998,337.9706,699.3561999999998],"fontSize":10},{"text":"11,20,23","rect":[337.9694,693.6074,360.30996,699.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Studies have additionally demonstrated","rect":[365.40950000000004,689.3598999999999,535.5045000000002,699.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"the role of telestroke in SSOC, with potential benefits","rect":[301.4995,677.3598999999999,535.5085000000001,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"that include triage and transfer of patients eligible for EVT","rect":[301.4995,665.3598999999999,535.5194999999999,675.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"as well as identification of patients 